import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const f=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 131 | Realm Refinement · Dao Origin Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 131 | Realm Refinement · Dao Origin Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","no":131,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Origin Realm","Myriad Races","Differentiated Cultivation","Attaining the Dao"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis","10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0131_模块1-道元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md","filePath":"en/0131_模块1-道元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"}'),s={name:"en/0131_模块1-道元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"};function n(r,e,l,c,h,d){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-131-dao-origin-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" tabindex="-1">Entry 131 | Dao Origin Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-131-dao-origin-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 131 | Dao Origin Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 50, 52, 10</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-each-race-s-dao-is-billions-of-ways-of-living" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Each race&#39;s &quot;Dao&quot; is billions of ways of living <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-each-race-s-dao-is-billions-of-ways-of-living" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Each race&#39;s &quot;Dao&quot; is billions of ways of living&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Law Realm (Entry 124) covered each race&#39;s kinship with laws; the Dao Realm&#39;s differentiation deepens into &quot;Dao forms.&quot; A human&#39;s Dao is a road, a beast tribe&#39;s Dao is a kind of blood, the wood tribe&#39;s Dao is a stretch of growth, a spirit tribe&#39;s Dao is an elemental reincarnation, a machine tribe&#39;s Dao is a self-consistent system — the same &quot;attaining the Dao,&quot; but the Daos each race establishes are fundamentally not the same thing. Using one Dao standard to measure all Myriad Races is pressing billions of ways of living into one success manual.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the legislative foundation of Myriad Race differentiation: the anti-predation axiom — each race establishes Dao without plagiarism or monopoly; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — equal evolutionary qualification regardless of genealogy; the collective ascension axiom — each race&#39;s Dao must feed back into civilization, eliminating talent underuse; the causal self-discipline axiom — cross-race Dao dialogue respects others&#39; causality; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of the Myriad Race Dao differentiation system is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-dao-realm-differences-across-five-genealogies" tabindex="-1">I. Dao Realm Differences Across Five Genealogies <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-dao-realm-differences-across-five-genealogies" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Dao Realm Differences Across Five Genealogies&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Myriad Races Genealogy Overview (Document 50) and Document 14:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Genealogy</th><th>Representative groups</th><th>Dao Realm features</th><th>Dao form inclination</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Carbon-based material</td><td>Humans, beasts, wood tribe</td><td>Dao carries flesh-life breath, resonates with matter</td><td>Road, blood, growth</td></tr><tr><td>Energy condensation</td><td>Spirits, elemental life</td><td>Dao is the element itself, resonates with energy</td><td>Elemental reincarnation</td></tr><tr><td>Mechanical construction</td><td>Machine tribe</td><td>Dao is a self-consistent system, resonates with structure</td><td>Precision system</td></tr><tr><td>Consciousness information</td><td>Consciousness entities</td><td>Dao is logical self-consistency, resonates with consciousness</td><td>Pure logic</td></tr><tr><td>Hybrid variation</td><td>Half-bloods, exotic life</td><td>Starting points vary wildly, case assessment</td><td>Compatibility first</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Dao Realm version of &quot;substance over name&quot;: the unified standard assesses &quot;whether a self-consistent Dao resonating with cosmic laws has been formed,&quot; not the specific Dao form.</p><h2 id="ii-dao-attainment-paths-of-each-race-every-race-has-its-dao" tabindex="-1">II. Dao-Attainment Paths of Each Race: Every Race Has Its Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-dao-attainment-paths-of-each-race-every-race-has-its-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Dao-Attainment Paths of Each Race: Every Race Has Its Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Beast tribe: Dao is &quot;taming of wildness,&quot; refining bloodline instinct into a blood-resonating Dao of Blood</li><li>Wood tribe: Dao is &quot;philosophy of growth,&quot; a century of growth coagulates into the Dao of Life-Nurturing</li><li>Spirit tribe: Dao is &quot;elemental self-awareness,&quot; wind-fire-water-earth coagulate into the Dao of Reincarnation</li><li>Machine tribe: Dao is &quot;system self-consistency,&quot; coagulating topological logic into a precision Dao</li><li>Consciousness tribe: Dao is &quot;clarity of logic,&quot; coagulating consciousness itself into a pure Dao</li></ul><h2 id="iii-cross-race-co-cultivation-the-civilizational-dialogue-of-dao" tabindex="-1">III. Cross-Race Co-Cultivation: The Civilizational Dialogue of Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cross-race-co-cultivation-the-civilizational-dialogue-of-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cross-Race Co-Cultivation: The Civilizational Dialogue of Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Cross-race mentors: beast mentors help human students understand the Dao of Blood; machine mentors help consciousness students achieve system self-consistency — the Dao-layer form of Myriad Race origin two-way circulation</li><li>Half-blood compatibility: half-bloods go through system compatibility assessment, eliminating race labeling</li><li>Equal certification: realm certification recognizes only Dao self-consistency and resonance, not birth</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-racial-narrow-mindedness-is-the-welfare-ceiling" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: Racial Narrow-Mindedness is the Welfare Ceiling <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-racial-narrow-mindedness-is-the-welfare-ceiling" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: Racial Narrow-Mindedness is the Welfare Ceiling&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo-style old-era universal welfare system only recognizes human-style &quot;Dao,&quot; dismissing beast blood and wood growth as &quot;heretical branches.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: the Dao Realm is not humanity&#39;s Dao-establishment temple, but a pantheon of Myriad Races&#39; ways of living — 99% coverage, not a single race missing.</p><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-each-race-s-dao-embraces-origin" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Each Race&#39;s Dao Embraces Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-each-race-s-dao-embraces-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Each Race&#39;s Dao Embraces Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Daos established by each race in the Dao Realm must, entering Dao Integration, each embrace cosmic origin in billions of poses. The beast tribe&#39;s Dao of Blood must let &quot;wildness return to heaven and earth&quot;; the wood tribe&#39;s Dao of Life-Nurturing must let &quot;growth breathe with origin&quot;; the spirit tribe&#39;s Dao of Reincarnation must let &quot;elements return to the torrent&quot;; the machine tribe&#39;s Dao of System must &quot;access the origin substrate&quot;; the consciousness tribe&#39;s Dao of Clarity must &quot;merge into the law network.&quot; The Myriad Race origin two-way circulation manifests at this handover as: each race&#39;s Dao integration pose differs, yet all embrace origin in the same direction. Half-bloods need system compatibility assessment at this handover — if two Daos are uncoordinated, they pull against each other during Dao integration.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: each race&#39;s Dao is a scarce way of living; a single-Dao standard is the greatest waste</li><li>Anti-predation: all races&#39; Dao establishment is based on public laws and self-cultivation, none on plagiarism</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: racially narrow universal welfare is not welfare, but patronage</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: five genealogies + exotic life + multiverse residual civilizations all within the Dao Realm&#39;s 99% coverage</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: each race&#39;s Dao-establishment methods are openly shared, the fifth link of the fully open chain is race-blind</li></ul><p>The ten thousand poses of each race&#39;s Dao embracing origin are the most vivid footnote of &quot;hyper-multiverse.&quot; Hyper-multiverse does not demand Myriad Races converge, but lets billions of Daos each find their place at the origin layer without mutual swallowing. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization dares to speak of the &quot;Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot; precisely because of this: when the beast tribe&#39;s blood and the machine tribe&#39;s system, the wood tribe&#39;s growth and the consciousness tribe&#39;s clarity can all coexist harmoniously in origin, this cosmos possesses the legal foundation to carry infinite plurality without collapsing — this is precisely the highest proof of the law-first axiom.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Dao Realm&#39;s Myriad Races ways-of-living panorama proves: Dao forms are billions, but the direction of Dao is one — resonate with the cosmos, give back to Myriad Races. When beast blood and machine system converse in the same Dao temple, Myriad Race symbiosis moves from &quot;allowing difference&quot; to &quot;needing difference.&quot;</p><p>&quot;All Daos share one origin, all laws mutually verify&quot; is not rhetoric, but Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s philosophical confidence in daring to speak of &quot;hyper-multiverse.&quot; When billions of Daos mutually fulfill rather than mutually swallow at the origin layer, this cosmos elevates from &quot;plural coexistence&quot; to &quot;plural symbiosis&quot; — this is precisely the true meaning of Balanced Anchor.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Dao Realm Myriad Race differentiated cultivation system described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</a> · <a href="./52-异族分类与共生.html">52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis</a> · <a href="./10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const m=a(s,[["render",n]]);export{f as __pageData,m as default};
